Drawing design system
Project: Moon Mesh — Miso, Pip, Plum and Sprout
Purpose: Direct an illustration agent to create original, warm, handmade-looking colouring-book drawings with the bold, inviting readability of the supplied Coco Wyo references.
Version: 2.0 — 10 November 2026
Default reader: Children ages 6–9, with optional shared reading.
Default deliverable: One finished, uncoloured illustration on white, suitable for a single printed colouring page.
Read this as an art-direction and production specification. Its numerical settings are proposed house settings, except where a cited platform requirement is identified. They are not measured Coco Wyo specifications, universal child-development thresholds, or promises about image-model performance.
