Stiff or generic direction	More useful drawing direction
Miso smiles while holding a bowl	Miso leans over one broad bowl, paws touching its sides, eyes lowered toward the dough
Two cute friends drink tea	Plum turns toward Miso while setting down the second cup, leaving a clear space between their faces
